  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nRecently renovated and exclusively occupying a major share of the land holding. This spacious and solidly constructed 1960’s brick and tile semidetached home is much, much more than a unit. Featuring elevated ceilings and polished timber flooring, the kitchen has been stylishly upgraded with new cabinetry and benchtops and will fast become the social hub of the home when entertaining family and friends as it is open plan to the lounge which flows to the generous outdoor deck and lawn. There is a modernised and functional bathroom and the two double bedrooms have elevated ceilings that adds to the sense of spaciousness.\r\n\r\nThe large north facing lawn is fully fenced and has a seamless connection to the sizeable timber deck making this the perfect space for outdoor entertaining and afternoon summer barbeques whilst watching children and pets at play. There is plenty of off-street parking provided and the large outdoor garden shed complete with power is a great asset for the storage of hobbies and sporting equipment.\r\n\r\nSituated close to Smales Farm Business Park and the North Shore Hospital, the property is zoned for excellent schooling including Westlake Boys’ and Westlake Girls’, TNIS, Carmel College, Rosmini College, St Josephs, and Takapuna Primary Schools; all of which are within easy walking distance. The Shore City Shopping Centre together with the Takapuna commercial precinct and Takapuna Beach are just a 15-minute walk away or there is excellent public transport available at the door.\r\n\r\nThis is much, much more than a unit and properties with these attributes rarely become available in such a desirable neighbourhood. Our vendors have given clear instructions to sell on or prior to auction day, so make viewing of this home your first priority.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
